case('reconcile-reviewer','Ordered reconciliation of reviewer findings','有序协调评审发现','evaluation','skills/doubt-driven-development/SKILL.md',168,179,
 'Treat reviewer output as hypotheses and classify against the actual artifact before acting.','Check contract misread first, then actionable defect, accepted tradeoff and context-caused noise; fix the contract before repeating review when it caused the error.','Review a cache that intentionally returns stale data under a stated tolerance.','Fix every reviewer complaint or dismiss all disagreement as noise.','Re-read each finding: clarify the missing tolerance first; fix a real unbounded-staleness path; record an accepted latency tradeoff separately.','The artifact changes only for validated actionable findings, with contract failures distinguished.','Classification is an editorial judgment; a reviewer disagreement alone proves neither author nor reviewer correct.','将评审输出视为假设，行动前按实际产物分类。','先查契约误读，再查可行动缺陷、接受权衡、背景噪声；契约致误则先修契约再评审。','评审明确容忍一定陈旧的数据缓存。','每条意见都修，或全当噪声。','逐条复读：先补缺失容忍；修真正无界陈旧路径；单独记可接受延迟权衡。','只为已验证可行动发现改产物，区分契约缺陷。','分类是编辑判断；分歧本身不证明作者或评审者正确。')
case('cached-reading-relevance','Resource freshness versus reading relevance','资源新鲜度与解读相关性','context','hooks/SDD-CACHE.md',57,80,
 'A fresh resource validator does not make a previously transformed answer relevant to a different question.','Record both source version and transformation question; reuse a derived reading only when it covers the new task, otherwise refetch or rederive from raw content.','Reuse documentation first read for an API signature while researching its error semantics.','Origin says 304, so the old signature-only summary answers the error question.','Check the original extraction prompt; if it only requested signatures, fetch the missing error section or rederive from the unchanged raw page.','Unchanged source content is not mistaken for complete coverage of the new question.','The observed hook is URL-only and leaves relevance judgment to the agent; it does not enforce this invariant automatically.','源验证器确认新鲜，不使旧变换答案适合另一问题。','同时记录来源版本与变换问题；派生解读覆盖新任务才复用，否则重取或按原文重新解读。','错误语义研究复用之前只读接口签名的文档。','来源304，所以旧签名摘要能答错误问题。','检查原提取提示；只问签名则取缺失错误章节，或按未变原页面重推。','不把来源未变误作新问题已完整覆盖。','观察到的钩子只以URL为键，把相关性留给代理判断，并不自动强制不变量。')
case('derived-validator-binding','Bind a derived artifact to its actual input revision','将派生产物绑定实际输入修订','evaluation','hooks/sdd-cache-post.sh',75,135,
 'Validate derivation order so a later source revision cannot be attached to an earlier derived body.','Capture content and its validator from the same fetch, or re-fetch when a later validation may refer to another revision.','Cache a model extraction of a changing documentation page.','Extract revision A, then issue HEAD after revision B appears and tag the A summary with B ETag.','Store the response validator that accompanied A; if only a later HEAD is available, verify the body again before binding that validator.','A later 304 cannot falsely certify an older derived summary.','This is a static source-race inference; the audit did not execute or reproduce it against a live server.','核对派生顺序，避免将后来的来源版本贴到早期派生正文。','同次获取正文与验证器；后验证可能属别版本时重取。','缓存变化文档页的模型摘要。','提取A后页面变B，再HEAD并用B的ETag标A摘要。','存伴随A响应的验证器；仅有后HEAD时，绑定前重新核正文。','后来的304不误认证更旧摘要。','这是静态来源竞争推断，本审计未运行或向服务复现。',ids=[178])
case('safe-artifact-channel','Pass review artifacts through inert input channels','通过惰性输入通道传评审产物','safety','skills/doubt-driven-development/SKILL.md',127,152,
 'Preserve artifact text as data when invoking an external reviewer.','Write the full artifact/contract prompt to a file and feed stdin; verify the tool and use a read-only execution boundary.','Review code containing backticks and command-substitution syntax.','Interpolate the source directly into a shell command argument.','Write the exact prompt to a file, pass the file on stdin to the verified read-only reviewer, and retain the invocation/result provenance.','Shell metacharacters in the artifact do not become shell instructions.','A read-only wrapper limits filesystem effects, not all prompt-injection or external-data risk; host flags must be verified.','调用外部评审时保持产物文本为数据。','完整产物契约提示写文件，经标准输入传递；验证工具并用只读边界。','评审含反引号与命令替换语法的代码。','源内容直接插入shell命令参数。','确切提示写文件，标准输入传给已验证只读评审，保留调用结果来源。','产物元字符不成为shell指令。','只读包装限制文件影响，非所有提示注入和外部数据风险；宿主标志须核。')

case('check-lifecycle-cost','Place checks by feedback cost','按反馈成本安排检查','workflow','skills/constraint-driven-development/SKILL.md',186,200,
 'Keep fast feedback near edits and place expensive checks at explicit later gates.','Name each check target, lifecycle phase and cost budget; reuse existing evidence rather than running the same unchanged suite twice.','Verify a frontend change with types, browser accessibility and mutation checks.','Run every full-repository check after every keystroke.','Run affected types/lint after edits, related tests at task end and costly browser/mutation checks at preview or CI, each with its declared result.','Fast iteration retains an inspectable final quality gate.','Cost estimates and source tool commands need local measurement/version verification; moving a check must not silently remove it.','快速反馈近编辑，昂贵检查在明确后门。','为每检查命名目标、阶段和成本，复用已有证据，不重复跑未变整套。','以类型、浏览器可访问和突变检查验证界面变化。','每敲字都运行所有整库检查。','编辑后跑受影响类型lint，任务末跑相关测试，浏览器突变检查在预览或CI，均明确结果。','快速迭代仍有可审最终质量门。','成本命令须本地测量核版本；后移检查不可暗删。')
case('guard-quality-bar','Review changes to the quality bar itself','评审质量门槛自身变化','evaluation','skills/constraint-driven-development/SKILL.md',202,225,
 'Review the validator as well as the implementation so green cannot be bought by weakening the contract.','Compare baseline thresholds, skipped/deleted tests, removed assertions, suppressions, stubs and new exceptions; require explained scoped exceptions.','Fix a failing coverage gate.','Lower the required coverage and skip a failing test, then report green.','Compare the gate against the branch baseline; keep its threshold, fix the uncovered behavior or record an owned expiring exception for review.','A successful verdict retains the originally accepted bar.','A shallow diff guard can false-flag legitimate rewrites and miss semantic weakening; findings require review.','评审验证器与实现，防止削弱契约换绿。','比较基准阈值、跳过删除测试、移除断言、抑制、桩和新例外，例外须解释且限定。','修复失败覆盖门。','降低覆盖要求并跳过失败测试，再报绿。','对照分支基准，保持阈值，修未覆行为或提交有负责人到期的例外待评审。','成功结论保留原接受门槛。','浅层diff护栏可误报合法改写，漏语义削弱；须复核发现。')
case('measured-ratchet','Measured baseline ratchet','测量基准棘轮','evaluation','skills/constraint-driven-development/SKILL.md',226,233,
 'Adopt a measured nonregression direction when an arbitrary target would fail the inherited baseline.','Record metric value, measurement conditions, allowed direction and tolerance; compare equivalent runs and update improved baselines.','Set a quality gate on a legacy project.','Demand an invented80% threshold the inherited project cannot pass.','Measure the current changed-line coverage, record the baseline/command and require no comparable regression; define separate improvement work.','The gate detects deterioration without pretending the inherited state is already ideal.','Changing denominator/workload can invalidate comparison; a ratchet is not proof of sufficient absolute quality.','任意目标使继承基准必败时采用实测不退步方向。','记录值、条件、允许方向及容差，比较等价运行，改善时更新基准。','为遗留项目设质量门。','强设继承项目无法达的80%。','测当前覆盖，记录基准与命令，要求可比条件下不退步；改善另立工作。','门能检退化而不假装继承状态已理想。','分母或负载变化使比较失效；棘轮不证明绝对质量足够。')
