case('noise-aware-intervention','Noise-aware intervention comparison','考虑噪声的干预比较','evaluation','skills/performance-optimization/SKILL.md',368,389,
 'Compare one change under equivalent measurement conditions and require signal beyond normal variance.','Keep command, workload and budget constant; repeat measurements, preserve correctness gates and decide against the observed noise range.','Evaluate a parser optimization.','Compare a cold baseline once with a warm optimized run and call a small delta a win.','Run both revisions on the same workload and cache conditions; compare repeated timings and retain the change only if the effect exceeds normal variation while correctness holds.','The measured effect is attributable to the tested intervention.','Variance estimates depend on sample quality; changes with intentional nonperformance benefits need a separate benefit contract.','在等价测量条件比较单个变化，并要求超过正常波动。','固定命令负载预算，重复测量，保留正确性门，再按噪声范围决定。','评估解析器优化。','一次冷基准对一次暖优化，小差就称赢。','相同负载缓存条件测两修订，比较重复计时，仅差异超过正常波动且正确性保持才留。','测量效果可归因于所试干预。','方差估计依赖样本质量；另有明确非性能收益的变化需要另立收益契约。')
